    },
    {
      "id": "r0028",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你身上有香火味，昨天去了寺庙？",
      "next": "r0029",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0029",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "别打哈哈。",
      "next": "r0031",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0031",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "朋友要做傻事，自当来劝一劝。",
      "next": "r0032",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0032",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "什么傻事？",
      "next": "r0034",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0034",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "嫂子的事，节哀。",
      "next": "r0035",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0035",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "人人都会这么说，有什么用呢。",
      "next": "r0036",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0036",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "难道你想做的事情就有用了？",
      "next": "r0037",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0037",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "没用。",
      "next": "r0038",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0038",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "……",
      "next": "r0039",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0039",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我只是想再见一见她。",
      "next": "r0041",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0041",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "天宝之乱结束后，你就离开了朝廷，我不知道你是自己的选择还是他们把你赶走的。",
      "next": "r0042",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0042",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我自己走的。现在的朝廷已经不需要一名方相了。",
      "next": "r0043",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0043",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "是吗。听说他们还曾召你回去？",
      "next": "r0044",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0044",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "他们只是需要我的能力。",
      "next": "r0045",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0045",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你没去？",
      "next": "r0046",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0046",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我有更重要的事情要做。",
      "next": "r0047",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0047",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "关于嫂子吗。",
      "next": "r0049",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0049",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "谁派你来的？",
      "next": "r0050",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0050",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "只是提醒下你，我不想看见曾经的朋友误入歧途。十五摆渡人中，你的镜子最危险——和你一样危险。",
      "next": "r0051",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0051",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我？危险？谁告诉你的。",
      "next": "r0052",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0052",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "崔皓。",
      "next": "r0053",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0053",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "她已经不在这里了，她不再是人类了。你明明知道的，人死后灵魂会成妖，生活在另一个世界里，我们干涉不了，他们除了自愿转世轮回也不能离开，从古至今，都从未有例外。",
      "next": "r0054",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0054",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "别给我念这些旧得快腐烂的规矩。",
      "next": "r0055",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0055",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你知道这些规矩不拦你，但你知道你要做什么吗。",
      "next": "r0056",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0056",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "但是，有例外。",
      "next": "r0057",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0057",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我没有见过例外。",
      "next": "r0058",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0058",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "……",
      "next": "r0059",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0059",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我只是再见她一面。我不会动用镜。",
      "next": "r0060",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0060",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "真的吗？",
      "next": "r0061",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0061",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "谁告诉你的，你的往生镜吗。",
      "next": "r0063",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0063",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "如果我告诉你，你会相信吗？",
      "next": "r0064",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0064",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不。",
      "next": "r0065",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0065",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那如果我知道她在哪儿呢？",
      "next": "r0066",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0066",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "……我只想亲自验证。",
      "next": "r0068",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0068",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "李诏阳",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我最后提醒你。你是摆渡人，你要守住你的规矩，别动她。",
      "next": "r0069",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0069",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我只是想……再见她一次。",
